{
  "description": "The postgres_flex spec (v3) documents 423 and 412 on these operations (`responses.423`: 'Locked: The instance is not yet ready to perform this operation', example type INSTANCE_NOT_READY_ERROR; `responses.412`: 'Precondition Failed', example type FAILED_PRECONDITION_ERROR), but convert drops both statuses because the model has no error shape for them, so they surface as UnknownStackitError. STACKIT's own Terraform provider (stackitcloud/terraform-provider-stackit, stackit/internal/services/postgresflex/user/resource.go and database/resource.go, read 2026-11-01) retries http.StatusLocked on create, update and delete of users and databases. No live probe: the operations and statuses come from the spec, not from a guess at the wire.",
